export anchor TonalBlocksStyle:
    number: 203
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Tonal blocks
    idea: Each section is a soft block of its own muted colour, sand, sage, sky, rose and lilac, separated only by space, with no outlines or shadows anywhere.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #f8f6f1, the warm page between blocks
        deep: #2e3f3a, the header block
        deepRaised: #415550, the search field and bell on the header
        onDeepMuted: #cfdcd7, idle nav and the placeholder on the header
        sand: #ede4d4, the greeting block, current nav, header button and fields
        sage: #dde7da, the chart block and the active projects block
        sageBand: #ccdac8, the last week band inside the chart
        sky: #dce6ef, the projects block and the tasks due block
        skyRow: #eaf0f6, project rows inside the sky block
        lilac: #e7e1ef, the activity block and the hours block
        rose: #f3dedb, the overdue block and the overdue line
        text: #1e2522, text
        muted: #4a524e, labels and meta on every tone
        accent: #2b5a4d, the primary button and this week bars
        lastWeek: #5e7560, last week bars on the sage band
        skyInk: #284f78, progress fill on the sky track
        ok: #21613c, On track on #d4e6d5 with a check circle
        risk: #774800, At risk on #f2e2c4 with a triangle
        behind: #9e261d, Behind on #f3d6d2 with a crossed square and overdue
    type:
        Body uses system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif. Headings and figures use Charter,
        Bitstream Charter, Sitka Text, Cambria, Georgia, serif. The
        greeting is 38px serif at 600, KPI figures 44px serif, block titles
        22px serif, row names 15px sans at 650, body 15px at 1.55 and meta
        13px.
    layout:
        A deep green header block with rounded corners holds a sand B tile
        with the serif brand, six pill nav links with Home on a sand pill,
        a darker pill search, a sand New project pill, a round bell and
        the initials disc. The first row splits five to seven. On the left
        a tall sand greeting block has the date and a serif greeting at
        top and a rose inner block at the bottom with a clock, 4 tasks are
        overdue and a Review them link. On the right four KPI blocks sit
        two by two, sage, sky, rose and lilac, each a small icon label over
        a big serif figure, overdue in red with a clock. The second row
        splits eight to four. A sky projects block lists six lighter sky
        rows, each with name and team, percent and tasks over a tonal
        progress bar, due date with days left and a tinted status tag. A
        lilac activity block lists entries with lilac initial discs. The
        last row is a full width sage chart block with serif totals 73, 59
        and +14 on the left and two tonal week bands on the right, last
        week bars in muted green and this week bars in deep green. Below
        1100px the rows stack. On phones project rows wrap and the week
        bands stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between blocks, 24 to 32px inside blocks and 8px between rows inside a block.
    density: Comfortable and calm. Large serif figures and one subject per block.
    corners: 14px blocks, 10px inner rows and bands, full pills for nav, search and buttons.
    borders: None at all. Blocks and rows are told apart by tone and space only.
    shadows: None. Depth is only a step lighter or darker in tone.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.8 stroke beside block labels. Status tags are
        tinted with a check circle, a triangle or a crossed square and the
        word.
    focus: A 2px deep green outline offset 3px, white on the header block.
    tone: Warm and plain, such as Review them, All activity and more than last week.
